<title>UK: Carpetright chief Harris to sell 4 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Carpetright chief Harris to sell 4 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carpetright Plc said on Thursday that its chairman and chief executive Lord Harris intended to sell up to four million ordinary in the company held for his benefit, including shares held for his charitable trust.</p>
<p>Carpetright said that after the sale he would retain a beneficial interest of not less than 12.08 million shares representing 15.2 percent of the company's ordinary share capital.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
